  "state": "scoped-qualified",
  "acceptance": false,
  "complete_requirement_coverage": false,
  "baseline_commit": "522cd85",
  "scope": "Native C++ RgbContrastSessionEditor and installed Python methods set_saved_stage/remove_saved_stage/move_saved_stage admit every candidate before replacing immutable state, preserve frozen geometry/whole-plane policy and visit positions, protect the live final draft and prevent empty historical visits. Movement stays within one visit. Shared C++/Python ImGui lists saved stages from all visits and supports actual selection, saved range/component editing, update, earlier/later movement and removal. Saved edits invalidate/recompute only private preview, retain current draft intent and commit complete records only at Apply. Sixty-five new installed tests cover order-sensitive literal bytes, all seven components, detached values, invalid bounds/masks/types/indices/draft access/empty-visit refusal, metadata-only admission, frozen geometry, source/history preservation, full recorded plans and paired Undo/Redo. Windows/Linux each pass 6219 installed Python checks, six native groups, an extended actual-input contrast-panel test, an installed public SDK consumer and three standalone UI probes. Native input physically selects list entries, edits a saved maximum and clicks Update/Move later/Remove before final Apply. Initial compilation lacked the explicit ImGui include; fixed exact variant retained. One Python test originally mutated a returned crosshair copy; corrected to whole-array assignment with unchanged product/numerical expectations; failed report/source variant retained. Windows preliminary 6209-check run passed before ten additional invalid-panel cases. Linux qualification002 completed native/install steps but refused its final source seal after an independent SDK CMake consumer was added; it is not called a qualified final run. Final003 includes that consumer and the component-name presentation, and passes both source seals; final004 extends only the native UI test with actual list selection, with production bytes unchanged. Final product ledgers and installed headers are rechecked. Disposable venvs, preliminary duplicate installs, pytest/native fixtures and SDK intermediates are archived with CRC/member-SHA checks before exact confined cleanup; final prefixes/native carriers/probes/reports/logs remain. No dependencies or old acceptance records are changed; original99 triples and the old Auto fingerprint gate remain unchanged. Full ImageJ/Fiji parity, historical geometry edits, cross-visit movement and arbitrary visit authoring remain open.",
